<section class="heros-soutien">
  <div class="conteneur">
    <h1>Support the project</h1>
    <p class="heros-soutien__definition">
      AZERTY Global is free, open source and carried by the AMCF.
    </p>
    <div class="heros-soutien__actions">
      <a href="https://www.helloasso.com/associations/association-pour-la-modernisation-du-clavier-francais/formulaires/1?lang=en"
         class="bouton bouton--primaire">Donate to the AMCF</a>
      <a href="https://www.helloasso.com/associations/association-pour-la-modernisation-du-clavier-francais/adhesions/adhesion-amcf?lang=en"
         class="bouton bouton--secondaire">Join the AMCF</a>
    </div>
    <p class="bloc-amcf heros-soutien__note">
      Donations go to the AMCF, an association under the French <em>loi 1901</em>, and are collected
      by HelloAsso. Microsoft is not the collector, even if you installed AZERTY Global
      from the Microsoft Store.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="conteneur prose">
    <h2 id="amcf">Why support the AMCF?</h2>
    <p>
      AZERTY Global is <strong>free</strong>, <strong>ad-free</strong>, <strong>free of advertising tracking</strong>
      and <strong>open source</strong> under the <a href="/licence" hreflang="fr">EUPL 1.2<span class="visuellement-cache"> (in French)</span></a> license.
      Co-founded in <strong>2017</strong>, it has been developed by one volunteer since 2018; the
      <strong>Association pour la Modernisation du Clavier Français</strong> (AMCF, the Association for the
      Modernization of the French Keyboard), an association under the French <em>loi 1901</em> founded in March 2026
      in Clermont-Ferrand, officially runs it.
    </p>
    <p><strong>Its missions:</strong></p>
    <ul class="soutien-liste">
      <li><strong>Develop and distribute</strong> free and open-source keyboard layouts</li>
      <li><strong>Raise awareness</strong> among schools, companies and institutions</li>
      <li><strong>Produce educational resources</strong> and guides</li>
      <li><strong>Collaborate with research</strong> to study how the layout is used</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The association operates in full transparency: every euro received is reinvested in the project.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="conteneur">
    <h2>What your support funds</h2>
    <div class="soutien-colonnes">
      <div>
        <h3>Your donations fund</h3>
        <ul class="soutien-liste">
          <li><strong>Technical tools</strong>: domain names, hosting, development software</li>
          <li><strong>On-the-ground presence</strong>: tech and general-public events, demo equipment (foldable keyboards with AZERTY Global stickers)</li>
          <li><strong>Communication</strong>: online advertising and partnerships to make the project known</li>
          <li><strong>Scientific studies</strong>: evaluating the effects of the layout on fatigue, speed and ergonomics, without presuming the results</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Your word of mouth helps</h3>
        <ul class="soutien-liste">
          <li>Convince <strong>schools and companies</strong> to try it</li>
          <li>Show institutions that an <strong>alternative exists</strong></li>
          <li>Build a <strong>community</strong> of users who help each other</li>
          <li>Strengthen the project’s <strong>credibility</strong> with decision-makers</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

